    "scenesThatPass": [
      "RAZIEL: Flee! Flee!\nSORSHA: Raziel. Did you think my mother would allow you to escape?\nSORSHA: This is what we're looking for. It bears the markings.",
      "SORSHA: Elora Danan will die!\nRAZIEL: By dawn, upon thirteen tolls of the runic drum!",
      "SORSHA: I have no family.\nRAZIEL: If we do not fight, and the baby dies, all hope for the future is lost. I shall face the danger alone if I have to.",
      "BAVMORDA: Sorsha!!\nSORSHA: I won't let you kill her!\nBAVMORDA: You are a weakling. Like you fa- ther! Can you not see that I am about to become all-powerful!\nSORSHA: No!!",
      "RAZIEL: The baby will be queen. It has been foretold, Bavmorda.\nBAVMORDA: My ritual will kill the prophecy! Now the child dies with it, its en- ergy exiled into oblivion! You see? I hold the power of the universe!\nRAZIEL: Not until your ritual is complete!\nBAVMORDA: And who will stop me? The elements are slaves to my command!"
    ]
  },
